<title>UK: Deutsche sets capped call warrants on DAX index.</title>
<headline>Deutsche sets capped call warrants on DAX index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>DB Capital Markets (Deutschland) GmbH has issued 30 million European-style call warrants, in three equal tranches, on the DAX index, lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said.</p>
<p> EXERCISE DATE   30.DEC.97		 PAYDATE	04.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT/DUES		  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  2984.0</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p> WARRANT	 STRIKE	CAP	  ISSUE PRICE</p>
<p> CALL A	  2,700 DEM   2,900 DEM  1.50 DEM</p>
<p> CALL B	  2,800 DEM   3,000 DEM  1.37 DEM</p>
<p> CALL C	  2,900 DEM   3,100 DEM  1.27 DEM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
